        {
          "title": "平面椅",
          "content": "<p>一位美国设计师发明了一种玻璃纤维椅，用户拿到手的就是一块平板。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202608/bg2026082405.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>花几分钟，将其拆开，组装起来就是一把椅子。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202608/bg2026082406.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这种平板设计，大大减少了运输体积、存储空间和运输成本。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202608/bg2026082407.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它依靠曲线的张力和互锁的部件，来提供足够的强度。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202608/bg2026082408.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
