          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202608/bg2026082602.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>终端查看 A 股 K 线图、市盈率、成交量的小工具。（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/11354\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@Folgerjun</a> 投稿）</p>",
